  <content>
    <description>The mission of the Open Apparel Registry is to maintain an open-source, neutral and
      publicly accessible database of every facility in the global apparel and footwear sector, for
      the purposes of enabling industry collaboration and improved identification of factories. This
      improved identification will be facilitated by the unique OAR ID allocated to each
      facility.</description>
    <subject>Textile supply chains</subject>
    <subject>Global textile facilities</subject>
    <landingPage>https://info.openapparel.org/</landingPage>
    <primaryAudience>practitioners</primaryAudience>
  </content>
